  "content_blocks": [
    {
      "block_id": "b00000",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Scope of Chapter 8",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "heading_path": [
        "Scope of Chapter 8"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In: Plan > Strategy and plan",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [
        "Scope of Chapter 8"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Overview",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [
        "Scope of Chapter 8",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This regulation provides that, except in limited circumstances, chapter 8 PCR 2015 applies to public procurements conducted by contracting authorities, where Part 2 of the PCR does not apply because the estimated value of the contract is below the thresholds as set out in regulation 5 (threshold amounts).",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [
        "Scope of Chapter 8",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Regulation 109 states that chapter 8 does not apply to below-threshold procurements where:",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "Scope of Chapter 8",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "the procurement would not have been subject to Part 2 PCR (for example, because it met one of the exclusions in regulation 10; specific exclusions for service contracts) even if the value of the public contract being procured was above threshold",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "Scope of Chapter 8",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "the public contract is being procured by a central government authority and has a value less than £12,000 (including VAT)",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Scope of Chapter 8",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "the public contract is being procured by a sub-central contracting authority (or an NHS Trust or NHS Foundation Trust) and has a value less than £30,000 (including VAT).",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "Scope of Chapter 8",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Contracting authorities are prohibited from sub-dividing contracts, where the aim of the subdivision is to prevent Chapter 8 applying (unless justified by objective reasons).",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "Scope of Chapter 8",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Objective at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "Scope of Chapter 8",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Chapter 8 of the PCR will apply to below-threshold procurements, unless the circumstances of the procurement fall into one of the exclusions set out in this regulation (i.e. regulation 109).",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "Scope of Chapter 8",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Key considerations at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "Scope of Chapter 8",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Contracting authorities should:",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [
        "Scope of Chapter 8",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "ensure the subject matter and value of any public contracts are reviewed and consideration is given as to whether Chapter 8 will apply.",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [
        "Scope of Chapter 8",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00014",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Legal framework",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "heading_path": [
        "Scope of Chapter 8",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00015",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "See also in the Procurement Act 2023:",
      "ordinal": 15,
      "heading_path": [
        "Scope of Chapter 8",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00016",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Section 84: Regulated below-threshold contracts",
      "ordinal": 16,
      "heading_path": [
        "Scope of Chapter 8",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00017",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Additional support and guidance",
      "ordinal": 17,
      "heading_path": [
        "Scope of Chapter 8",
        "Additional support and guidance"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00018",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Make sure you:",
      "ordinal": 18,
      "heading_path": [
        "Scope of Chapter 8",
        "Additional support and guidance"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00019",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "read the regulation",
      "ordinal": 19,
      "heading_path": [
        "Scope of Chapter 8",
        "Additional support and guidance"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00020",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "seek legal and commercial advice in the context of specific procurements",
      "ordinal": 20,
      "heading_path": [
        "Scope of Chapter 8",
        "Additional support and guidance"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00021",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "This applies to",
